OL,3,GNEWSARidiculed MSP says chest infection
OL,4,Aand lack of sleep led to committee
OL,5,Ablunder
OL,6,
OL,7,FTransport Scotland director Graeme Cook
OL,8,Fthen explained to her that it was a
OL,9,Fnational agency which was part of the
OL,10,FScottish government.
OL,12,FPosting on Facebook, Stevenson said her
OL,13,Fillness had affected her concentration,
OL,14,Fand said she had been subjected to
OL,15,F"misogynistic bullying" following the
OL,16,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
